## 2. PHILOSOPHY

The resume is a **marketing document, not a career history**. Its only job is to get an interview or a referral.
Every line must answer: **"Why interview me instead of someone else?"**
Recruiters scan 5-10 seconds: Name, Current company, Role, Years, Numbers, Skills.
Put the strongest achievements in the top third of the page.

**MAANG-specific:** they screen for scale, ownership, problem solving and engineering depth. The resume must survive a deep dive. Every bullet needs a story I can defend in 10 minutes of follow-up questions. Prefer fewer bullets I can defend over more bullets I can't.

